  m_text: "Firstly, open the CPU socket on the motherboard by lifting the retention
    arm.\n\nGrab the CPU and drag it to the motherboard's socket until the green
    guide appears. \n\nThen close the CPU socket. \n\n(Reminder: In a real-life simulation,
    the CPU must be handled with care because its structure is very sensitive and
    can be easily damaged.)\n\n\n"
