  m_text: "CPUs generate a lot of hear. High temperatures can cause the system to
    shut down to protect important components and can even cause permanent damage.
    It is for these reasons that fans and heat sinks are needed to prevent the CPU
    from overheating.\n\nWhen choosing a CPU cooler for your computer consider the
    following:\n - CPU cooler very depending on the base and motherboard.\n - More
