      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'CPU''s are the brains of computers, mainly responsible for interpreting
    computer instructions and processing data in software. There are two major series
    of CPU products available on the market: Intel and AMD. Each manufacturer has
    its own advantages, it should be noted is that each motherboard has its corresponding
    CPU socket. For Example, the Intel X299 platform only works with Intel processors
    that use LGA 2066 socket.


    Performance is reflected in the number of cores,
    clock frequency, ability to increase performance and cache size.'
